@crew calder
// Head writer 4: career lines. Exact, fair; worried shows as asking for the numbers again. Never a lecture twice.
== career.worried
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.up
- On time again. Good.
- On the board this morning. Ten to eight. Good. Good.
== career.bye
? flag:career.lastday
- The Tern won't wait. Don't be late for that one.
== career.seeoff
? flag:career.lastday
- I came to check the ramp seals.
== career.leave
? flag:leave.booked
- Leave's booked. Noted. Better on paper than a surprise.
== career.back
? flag:leave.back
- Back. Good. Board's there.
